why Every Alliance quest of the Hall of Thanes in one run, lead-in included.

# The Hall of Thanes' Alliance quests in one guide: the Dark Iron Map in Dun
# Morogh, the pick-ups in Ironforge, one run through the dungeon, then the
# hand-ins. Steps already done are passed over, so the guide picks up wherever
# the chain stands.
#
# The chain: the Dark Iron Map (item 274268, from the Dark Iron Spies and
# Captain Beld in eastern Dun Morogh) starts 96391 Underground Map, for
# Earthseer Farsen, who gives 96393 Old Ironforge Incursion (Durgen
# Dirgehammer's Head, for King Magni). In Ironforge, Afadra Dunwall gives 96394
# The Restless Dead and Thom Filch 96403 Important Heirlooms. Inside, a Ghostly
# Attendant gives 96395 An Ancient Grudge (Faldrim Anvilmar), and the Treaty of
# Understanding (object 673474) starts 98423 The Treaty of Understanding, for
# King Magni.
#
# Left out: nothing of the Alliance's. The Hall of Thanes is a city dungeon of
# the Alliance (its door is in Ironforge), so the pack has no Horde guide for
# it.
#
# Inside: nothing in the data places the Ghostly Attendant, the treaty, the
# heirlooms or the bosses inside, so their goals stand at the door
# (@28.3,47.6, Ironforge) with `group 5`. The bosses come in the order of the
# client's dungeon journal (Faldrim Anvilmar, Infurnus, Plunder, Durgen
# Dirgehammer), not of a recorded run. Every quest goal is counted by the quest
# log, so a group that takes them in another order still gets each step ticked.
#
# Sources (facts only):
# - Quests, NPCs, items, objects and rewards: Polestar's reference data
#   (data/forever, built from QuestieDB Forever 1.1.4) and Polestar 0.4.1.1's
#   Codex page for the dungeon.
# - The door: players' recordings, as Polestar's Codex holds them
#   (data/codex/entrances.json).
# - What drops where: players' recordings (data/codex/recorded.json): the head
#   from Durgen Dirgehammer, the heirlooms from objects 652227 and 652228.
# - The dungeon's size, levels and bosses: the client's group finder and
#   dungeon journal, as Polestar's Codex page holds them (five players, levels
#   13 to 18).
# INGAME: where inside do the Ghostly Attendant and the Treaty of Understanding
#   stand? No recording has the treaty's object.

step The Dark Iron Map
  tip The Dark Iron Spies and Captain Beld in eastern Dun Morogh drop it. The map starts a quest.
  collect 274268
  accept 96391

step Earthseer Farsen
  turnin 96391
  accept 96393

step Afadra Dunwall
  zone Ironforge
  accept 96394

step Thom Filch
  accept 96403

step To the Hall of Thanes
  tip A dungeon for five players of level 13 to 18. Its door is in Ironforge.
  enter "The Hall of Thanes" @28.3,47.6

step The Restless Dead and the heirlooms
  along until leave
  kill 263389 x15 quest 96394.1 @28.3,47.6 group 5
  kill 263390 x10 quest 96394.2 @28.3,47.6 group 5
  collect 274289 x8 quest 96403.1 @28.3,47.6 group 5 -- The heirlooms lie about the halls: click them.

step Faldrim Anvilmar
  tip A Ghostly Attendant inside asks you to put the spirit of Faldrim Anvilmar to rest. Faldrim is the first boss in the client's journal.
  accept 96395 @28.3,47.6 group 5
  kill 261306 quest 96395.1 @28.3,47.6 group 5

step Ghostly Attendant
  turnin 96395 @28.3,47.6

step Durgen Dirgehammer
  tip Infurnus and Plunder come before him in the client's journal; no quest needs them. Durgen drops his head for King Magni.
  collect 274286 quest 96393.1 @28.3,47.6 group 5
  collect 281030 @28.3,47.6 optional -- The Treaty of Understanding, if you come across it: it starts a quest for King Magni.

step Before you leave
  label leave
  tip Whatever is still short for The Restless Dead and the heirlooms, finish it before you go.
  kill 263389 x15 quest 96394.1 @28.3,47.6 group 5
  kill 263390 x10 quest 96394.2 @28.3,47.6 group 5
  collect 274289 x8 quest 96403.1 @28.3,47.6 group 5

step The Treaty of Understanding
  when has 281030
  accept 98423

step King Magni Bronzebeard
  turnin 96393

step King Magni Bronzebeard
  when onquest 98423
  turnin 98423

step Afadra Dunwall
  turnin 96394

step Thom Filch
  turnin 96403
